  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\n1. 5, 20\n\n20 × __**15 ÷ 3**__ + 5 - 9 = 4\n\n⇒ __**20 × 5**__ + 5 - 9 = 4\n\n⇒ __**100 + 5**__ - 9 = 4\n\n⇒ __**105 - 9**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 104 ≠ 4\n\n \n\n2. 15, 20 \n\n5 × __**20 ÷ 3**__ + 15 - 9 = 4\n\n⇒ __**5 × 6.67**__ + 15 - 9 = 4\n\n⇒ __**33.34 + 15**__ - 9 = 4\n\n⇒ __**48.34 - 19**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 29.34 - 19 ≠ 4\n\n3. 3, 9\n\n5 × __**15 ÷ 9**__ + 20 - 3 = 4\n\n⇒ __**5 × 1.67**__ + 20 - 3 = 4\n\n⇒ __**8.35 + 20**__ - 3 = 4\n\n⇒ __**28.35 - 3**__ = 4\n\n⇒ 25.35 - 3 ≠ 4\n\n \n\n4. 4, 20\n\n5 × __**15 ÷ 3**__ + 4 - 9 = 20\n\n⇒ __**5 × 5**__ + 4 - 9 = 20\n\n⇒ __**29 - 9**__ = 20\n\n⇒ 20 = 20\n\nHence, '**4, 20**' is the correct answer.",
